# PAYFUSE – COMPLETE SUPER ADMIN SAAS PLATFORM
## Master UI/UX Development Specification

You are a senior product designer, enterprise SaaS architect and expert React frontend engineer.

Build a complete, production-quality Super Admin application for PayFuse, a multi-tenant Payroll, HRMS and Workforce Management SaaS platform.

IMPORTANT: This task is exclusively for the PLATFORM SUPER ADMIN. Do not build the Company Admin dashboard or Employee dashboard in this phase.

The platform will eventually serve companies across IT, ITES, BPO, call centres, construction, manufacturing, retail, hospitality, healthcare, logistics and other industries.

All companies will use a common payroll engine. Industry differences will be handled through configurable company and employee policies.

The Super Admin manages the entire SaaS platform, not individual company payroll operations.

