- Responsive card grid.

Mobile:
- Collapsible navigation drawer.
- Two-column KPI layout where space allows.
- Horizontally scrollable data tables.
- Mobile-friendly forms and dialogs.

Do not use excessive gradients, oversized illustrations or unnecessary animations.

Use subtle transitions and micro-interactions.

